      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Discussion",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "If `isUpgraded` is `true`, the customer has upgraded the subscription represented by this transaction to another subscription. This value appears in the transaction only when it’s `true`. To determine the service that the customer is entitled to, look for another transaction that has a subscription with a higher level of service.",
